  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">재과만 회원님들 중에<br>이번 임용고사 2차 준비하고 계신 분들을 위해<br>도움 자료를 만들었습니다.<br>&#160;<br>2차 시험 과목인<br>1. 수업설계 역량 평가<br>2. 수업실연<br>3. 심층면접&#160;<br>준비법 중심으로&#160;<br>7분짜리 영상을 만들었습니다.<br>&#160;<br>영상 시청하시고,&#160;<br>궁금한 점, 도움이 필요한 부분 있으면<br>댓글 달아주세요~<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/fAHrqrdBFlY?si=xQP-gPlOQ0G6GWNr\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/fAHrqrdBFlY?si=xQP-gPlOQ0G6GWNr</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fAHrqrdBFlY\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"600\" data-video-height=\"450\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/L77FW/dJMb9aKxMA4/VXQs4ogYAxTl5byuhqTQd0/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/q23LQ/dJMb85WLUmo/XFsDtU8BKyiTo2OkviyfT0/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/THlVy/dJMb8SXqv7w/93PaoJAIHcDRHyOZzVcvlK/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fAHrqrdBFlY\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
